Live just a few steps from the sea! Cozy 1 bedroom flat in the heart of Albufeira, 200 m from the beach, with renovated kitchen, 2 balconies and side sea view. Ideal for holidays or investment.

Discover this cosy 1 bedroom flat, located in the heart of Albufeira, just 200 meters from the beach, in a privileged location, close to shops, restaurants, services and public transport.

With 57 m² of floor space, the flat has a functional distribution and bright environments, consisting of an entrance hall, renovated and recently equipped kitchen, bathroom with shower, spacious bedroom with built-in wardrobe and a bright living room with access to two small balconies, an excellent asset to enjoy the natural light and the side view of the sea.

Inserted in a quiet building with only five fractions, this property combines a central location with a more reserved environment.

Main features:

1 bedroom flat with 57 m² of floor space;

Renovated and equipped kitchen;

Spacious bedroom with built-in wardrobe;

Bathroom with shower;

Bright living room with access to two small balconies;

Side view of the sea;

About 200 meters from the beach;

Building with only five fractions;

Central location, close to shops, restaurants, services and transport.

A versatile opportunity, ideal as a holiday home, own home or investment, benefiting from the proximity to the beach and the attractions of the centre of Albufeira.

